# "Draw a card for each creature you control with flying": Bot2's Ornithopter (a flier) is not one Bot1 controls, and Bot1's only
# creature, an Elvish Mystic, has no flying, so cast for {1}{U}{U} (Black Lotus' three blue) Winged Portent counts zero and draws nothing
# (CR 121.2: drawing zero cards is no draw). Bot1's hand is the 7 - 2 - 1 = 4 cards left after the Lotus, the Mystic and the Portent
# are cast.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Elvish Mystic
Winged Portent
Island
Island
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Elvish Mystic.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Winged Portent.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Winged Portent; Black Lotus
Bot1.Hand.Count = 4
